# Build artifacts and VCS metadata: never needed as Docker build context,
# and target/ in particular can be tens of GB, which turns every parity
# harness build into a multi-minute (or multi-gigabyte-timeout) context
# transfer for no benefit — neither Dockerfile reads a pre-built target/.
/target/
/.git/

# Reference-only trees no Dockerfile build step touches.
/old/
/harness/
/docs/

# Stray crash dumps and editor/OS cruft that sometimes land in the repo root.
core.*
*.swp
.DS_Store
